+    /*
+     * Local patch: at END_FRAME the host copies the decoded picture into the
+     * target's plane resources, a host-side write the guest doesn't see. Mark
+     * them dirty, as draws, blits and copies do, so a later map reads them
+     * back from the host instead of returning the guest's never-written copy
+     * (vaGetImage gave flat frames). The readback is queued after END_FRAME.
